    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/4263de60a1e46d93468987deee472dc2.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/4263de60a1e46d93468987deee472dc2.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/4263de60a1e46d93468987deee472dc2.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Moen </strong>is a multiplayer 3D platformer where your goal is to climb at the top of the mountain! Your only adversary is gravity itself. However, you're not alone! As you ascend you will encounter other players! you can gather mushrooms, partake in various activities, or just chill out and enjoy the view.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/fb45cdd293dc604f3dc155263d3e215d.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/fb45cdd293dc604f3dc155263d3e215d.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/fb45cdd293dc604f3dc155263d3e215d.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Features:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Lush, Immersive 3D Environments:</strong><br>Traverse and explore beautifully landscapes teeming with life and detail.</li></ul>  <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Massively Multiplayer:</strong><br> Interact, communicate, and play with up to 250 players per server in a vast online world.</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/36da3ac099a118bf79b56882a5f919c8.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/36da3ac099a118bf79b56882a5f919c8.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/36da3ac099a118bf79b56882a5f919c8.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Unique Collectibles:</strong><br>Hunt for collectibles scattered throughout the game, adding an extra dimension of exploration and gameplay.</li></ul> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Character Customization:</strong><br>Tailor your in-game avatar to your style with a variety of colors.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/bf0d52013f739870d621a0bee81b8963.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/bf0d52013f739870d621a0bee81b8963.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/bf0d52013f739870d621a0bee81b8963.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/4263de60a1e46d93468987deee472dc2.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/4263de60a1e46d93468987deee472dc2.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/4263de60a1e46d93468987deee472dc2.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Moen </strong>is a multiplayer 3D platformer where your goal is to climb at the top of the mountain! Your only adversary is gravity itself. However, you're not alone! As you ascend you will encounter other players! you can gather mushrooms, partake in various activities, or just chill out and enjoy the view.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/fb45cdd293dc604f3dc155263d3e215d.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/fb45cdd293dc604f3dc155263d3e215d.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/fb45cdd293dc604f3dc155263d3e215d.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Features:</h2> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Lush, Immersive 3D Environments:</strong><br>Traverse and explore beautifully landscapes teeming with life and detail.</li></ul>  <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Massively Multiplayer:</strong><br> Interact, communicate, and play with up to 250 players per server in a vast online world.</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/36da3ac099a118bf79b56882a5f919c8.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/36da3ac099a118bf79b56882a5f919c8.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/36da3ac099a118bf79b56882a5f919c8.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Unique Collectibles:</strong><br>Hunt for collectibles scattered throughout the game, adding an extra dimension of exploration and gameplay.</li></ul> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Character Customization:</strong><br>Tailor your in-game avatar to your style with a variety of colors.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/bf0d52013f739870d621a0bee81b8963.poster.avif?t=1739566321\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/bf0d52013f739870d621a0bee81b8963.webm?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478450/extras/bf0d52013f739870d621a0bee81b8963.mp4?t=1739566321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
